**3. Suicide Prevention: Resources and Support**

If you or someone you know is struggling with suicidal thoughts, please reach out for help immediately. Here are some vital resources:

* **Suicide & Crisis Lifeline:** Call or text 988 in the US and Canada. In the UK, you can call 111.  This service is available 24/7, free, and confidential.  They can provide immediate support and connect you with local resources.  [https://988lifeline.org/](https://988lifeline.org/)
